## Kinbook's running stories and personal posts (docs/kinbook.md has the
## cast and the rules). A story is a run of posts that comes out one at a
## time while you play, so the same people keep turning up and their
## business moves along: Paulette's very hard time, the pothole called
## Bernard, Dale's campaign. Where each story's got to is kept in the save,
## so it carries on next time.
##
## A post here is the same shape as KinbookLines.POSTS, plus "by" (who
## posted it, shown for "wall" posts, their own page) and, for a ChipIn,
## "chipin": true with title, raised and goal. Comments are [who, text] or
## [who, text, true] for a reply.

